<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Cosipa to get 385 mln reais BNDES loan.</title>
<headline>Brazil Cosipa to get 385 mln reais BNDES loan.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian private steelmaker Cosipa will be signing Friday a loan agreement with Brazil's National Development Bank (BNDES) worth 385 million reais ($356.5 million), the BNDES said in a statement.</p>
<p>The loan is part of a total investment of 680 million reais ($629.6 million), the statement said.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
